      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WAH CEDAR (5) claimed his maiden two back when strongly fancied to break through then fourth last time, beaten 12 lengths (30.93) at this track over 525m. Back to track where he won his maiden. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. RAPID BURST (8) shows ability but remains a maiden after 14 starts. Was in the placings again last time finishing second (23.49) at Horsham. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Hard to beat again. WAH JARRAH (4) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (30.61) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Can hit the frame this time. SHAGGY PRINCESS (1) deserves plenty of thought at her first run at this distance.",
